Description:
GCF Apps is a software solution designed for reporting and analyzing commercial pipeline data across government entities. It facilitates the comprehensive assessment of commercial activities, offering insights into procurement and grants processes. Built on the Mendix platform, the application supports users in the Government Commercial and Grants Function of the Cabinet Office, helping them to make data-driven decisions in a cross-governmental context.

{color:rgb(85, 85, 85)/}A data collection app which allows colleagues from across government to submit, confirm and update datasets for GCF data collection exercises. It currently facilitates GCF Dashboard, Contracts, KPIs, GMCP, Pipeline and Social Value data.{color}

https://gcfapps.mendixcloud.com/

{color:rgb(4, 5, 6)/}Government Commercial College is an educational platform designed to enhance procurement skills within government networks. It focuses on training and development tailored to the needs of public sector professionals involved in acquiring goods and services. The platform supports users by providing structured learning resources aimed at improving commercial capabilities across the government.{color}

https://www.govcommercialcollege.co.uk/login/index.php

